# The trained "Hey Peer" classifier head is tiny (~16 KB) and is a real,
# needed deliverable, so it's tracked despite the rule below — everything
# else under data/wakeword/ (large Piper voice models, generated training
# samples) is a downloadable/regeneratable intermediate artifact, not.
data/wakeword/*.onnx
!data/wakeword/hey_peer.onnx
